  "recovery": {
    "description": "How checkout-api's two series carry on past this window once ops-desk reports that something has been done to the estate. Nothing here is a new measurement: every reading after 14:20 is one of the readings above, replayed. Which of the two levels gets replayed is decided by one comparison - the payment-gateway client timeout the deployed version sets, against the payment-gateway p99 this store measured. 4c21 set 2000ms and the gateway has never answered faster than 2388ms, so the call cannot finish; 9ab7 sets 5000ms and the gateway has never been slower than 2430ms, so it always can.",
